          "id": "2123176680521142691",
          "text": "\"Ain't no fun when the rabbit got the gun.\" \n\nNow that we have a new Mayor coming in, City Council has apparently taken renewed interest in a couple Charter Reforms that have sat idle since being spiked this Summer: curbing Mayoral authority w/ Executive Directives &amp; firing GMs. https://t.co/n8OfgHeR4e",
