          "id": "2123302559989563479",
          "text": "For nearly 4 yrs Council has repeatedly spiked Council Expansion proposals w/ this as their top excuse: \"Depts already feel like they are pulled in 16 directions so increasing # of CMs will only make that worse.\" \n\nThis proposal would do a hell of a lot more to make that worse! https://t.co/0pTBlCrBQv",
